                            In Dubai's demanding driving climate, regular vehicle inspections help motorists maintain safety and prevent costly mechanical failures. High ambient heat, sand exposure, and prolonged highway driving accelerate wear on cooling systems, batteries, rubber bushings, and tyres. Whether buying a pre-owned vehicle, preparing for annual registration renewal, or monitoring your car's general health, a workshop inspection provides an objective assessment of your vehicle's condition.
